# Security headers for every page served by Cloudflare Pages (copied to dist/ by Vite).
# A Content-Security-Policy will be added once the backend domains are final (Supabase migration).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
